{"data": [{"author_id": "1321270432385896448", "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:10:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114917649939329468"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/uQGYyjSazL", "end": 175, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Dragonhau66/status/2114917649939329468/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114917645472485377", "start": 152, "url": "https://t.co/uQGYyjSazL"}]}, "id": "2114917649939329468", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1621, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股今天（10月27日）的盘面，一句话就能说透：\n高开是诱饵，缩量是真相，个股在流血，底部还看不到希望？\n\n开盘倒是给了希望：\n三大指数集体高开，沪指微涨，创业板指涨0.89%，超2700只个股飘红，通信设备、半导体领涨。\n\n盘中希望破灭：\n没撑多久，三大指数集体翻绿。下跌个股迅速扩大到超2900只。 https://t.co/uQGYyjSazL", "url": "https://x.com/Dragonhau66/status/2114917649939329468"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-10-26T06:40:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114608146010505244"], "id": "2114608146010505244", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1455, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 下午观点 | 沪指翻红摸到3699，创业板还趴着跌1.57%，这波是权重拖指数不是全市场回血\n\n兄弟们，14点40分，把数字摆清楚：上证3694.04，涨0.10%；深成指11544.68，跌1.11%；创业板2641.94，跌1.57%。这三个数放一起，就是今天下午的全部真相——指数看着还行，账户体感很差。\n\n▪️", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2114608146010505244"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-10-27T06:39:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114970305311694865"], "id": "2114970305311694865", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1202, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 下午观点 | 双创午后直线杀跌，创指-1.6%、4500家下跌，银行零售硬扛旗（沪指14:37报3674.74 -0.62%）\n\n▪️", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2114970305311694865"}, {"author_id": "2108191189019381760", "created_at": "2026-10-27T08:46:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115002165194567970"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 27, "start": 23, "tag": "交易台"}]}, "id": "211