3.00%。\n全天成交额 1.47 万亿元人民币,较前一日下降 9.25%。\n今日港股、A 股表现弱于亚太区域其他市场,全天大部分时间走势平淡,尾盘最后 30", "url": "https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2115049576172589453"}, {"author_id": "1128198342859563008", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:11:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115053702306480354"], "id": "2115053702306480354", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 151, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📌GS CHINA WRAP GS 中国市场综述\n\n📉上证综指下跌 1.33%，科创 50 下跌 4.81%。\n📉上证 50 下跌 0.80%，创业板指下跌 3.41%。\n📉沪深 300 下跌 1.32%，中证 500 下跌 3.00%。\n💰全天成交额 1.47 万亿元人民币，较前一日下降 9.25%。\n🌤️今日港股、A", "url": "https://x.com/ming69621583/status/2115053702306480354"}, {"author_id": "2105582591122583552", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:38:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115060600623804530"], "id": "2115060600623804530", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 47, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📌GS CHINA WRAP GS 中国市场综述#交易台   \n\n📉上证综指下跌 1.33%，科创 50 下跌 4.81%。\n📉上证 50 下跌 0.80%，创业板指下跌 3.41%。\n📉沪深 300 下跌 1.32%，中证 500 下跌 3.00%。\n💰全天成交额 1.47 万亿元人民币，较前一日下降 9.25%。\n🌤️今日港股、A", "url": "https://x.com/HDchengzhu/status/2115060600623804530"}, {"author_id": "2108191189019381760", "created_at": "2026-10-27T01:34:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114893510042357886"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 15, "start": 11, "tag": "交易台"}]}, "id": "2114893510042357886", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 294, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📑GS 中国收盘速览\n#交易台 \n\n📊 上证综指上涨 0.19%,科创 50 下跌 2.23%。\n📊 上证 50 上涨 0.41%,创业板指下跌 1.71%。\n📊 沪深 300 下跌 0.04%,中证 500 下跌 1.49%。\n💴 全天成交总额 1.62 万亿元,较前一日下降 17.73%。\n📌 A 股各大指数收盘表现分化。上证综指在临近早盘收盘阶段拉升,最终收涨 19", "url": "https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2114893510042357886"}, {"author_id": "1128198342859563008", "created_at": "2026-10-26T12:33:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114696809654505536"], "id": "2114696809654505536", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 187, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GS 中国收盘速览\n\n📊 上证综指上涨 0.19%，科创 50 下跌 2.23%。\n📊 上证 50 上涨 0.41%，创业板指下跌 1.71%。\n📊 沪深 300 下跌 0.04%，中证 500 下跌 1.49%。\n💴 全天成交总额 1.62 万亿元，较前一日下降 17.73%。\n📌 A 股各大指数收盘表现分化。上证综指在临近早盘收盘阶段拉升，最终收涨 19", "url": "https://x.com/ming69621583/status/2114696809654505536"}, {"author_id": "2060298489305890816", "created_at": "2026-10-26T07:10:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114615527507366257"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/qdPY3sKLSz", "end": 34, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2114615527507366257/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114615513188085760", "start": 11, "url": "https://t.co/qdPY3sKLSz"}]}, "id": "2114615527507366257", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "收盘了，脸都不要了。 https://t.co/qdPY3sKLSz", "url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2114615527507366257"}, {"author_id": "895032812457181184", "created_at": "2026-10-27T14:46:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115092816082976991"], "id": "2115092816082976991", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "突发新闻：A股尾盘跳水！创业板盘中涨超1%到收盘反跌3.41%，全市场超4900只个股下跌", "url": "https://x.com/francia781119/status/2115092816082976991"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-10-26T02:37:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114547031805214848"], "id": "2114547031805214848", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 583, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 开盘速报 | 周一低开下杀，创业板重挫近2.9%，机器人成全场独苗\n\n▪️", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2114547031805214848"}, {"author_id": "2062811475446779905", "created_at": "2026-10-26T11:29:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114680896662217034"], "id": "2114680896662217034", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 126, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📈 10.26 复盘｜缩量到 1.61 万亿，上证贴五日微涨，成长回吐、消费油气护盘\n\n【量能】\n两市成交 16,088 亿（上证 7,465 + 深证综指口径 8,623），比上周五少 3,475 亿（-17.8%）。周五好不容易冲到 1.96 万亿，今天又掉回 1.61 万亿，离 1.8 万亿门槛还差约 1,900", "url": "https://x.com/Leodozqa/status/2114680896662217034"}, {"author_id": "2060298489305890816", "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:39:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114924806953173482"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/CHHdPZWfkT", "end": 177, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2114924806953173482/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114924794395406336", "start": 154, "url": "https://t.co/CHHdPZWfkT"}]}, "id": "2114924806953173482", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "午评：指数在装死，你的账户在真死\n\n上午收盘，沪指跌0.13%，深成指跌0.33%，创业板跌0.45%。光看这几个数，好像还挺体面——“小幅调整”嘛，岁月静好。但低头看一眼自己的持仓，超过3700只个股在跌。翻译成人话就是：指数在午休，你的账户在ICU里加班。\n\n第一，银行又在“救驾”了，可惜救的不是你。 https://t.co/CHHdPZWfkT", "url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2114924806953173482"}, {"author_id": "1088377627", "created_at": "2026-10-27T01:01:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114885237264327008"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 3, "start": 0, "tag": "A股"}, {"end": 7, "start": 4, "tag": "早评"}]}, "id": "2114885237264327008", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 578, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#A股 #早评 \n\n昨天沪指微涨0.19%，创业板跌1.71%，科创板跌2.23%，两市成交额缩至1.61万亿，较前一日减少3500亿！周五放量大反攻，周一却迅速缩量，说明增量资金没有持续进场，市场信心依然脆弱。\n\n现在判断行情，核心不是看指数红不红，而是看成交量能不能持续回升！", "url": "https://x.com/Sarah4u2013/status/2114885237264327008"}, {"author_id": "828621526270226434", "created_at": "2026-10-27T11:18:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115040413811880122"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 82, "start": 79, "tag": "A股"}]}, "id": "2115040413811880122", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【10月27日收评：明日大盘早盘可能延续今日尾盘的惯性下探 重点观察沪指3600点整数关口附近的抵抗情况 以及银行等权重板块是否继续护盘】\n\n        #A股", "url": "https://x.com/BaroGakul/status/2115040413811880122"}, {"author_id": "1713359202465251328", "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:16:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114919077479367104"], "id": "2114919077479367104", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股盘中解析（10月27日上午，截至约11:10）\n一句话定性：今天上午走的是一个 V 型修复——高开、冲高回落翻绿、10点后探底回升再翻红走强，不是单边行情，上午最重要的信号是市场广度的大反转。\n指数路径（时间线）\n•开盘：三大指数集体高开，上证 +0.02%、深证成指 +0.49%、创业板指", "url": "https://x.com/zhou1492987/status/2114919077479367104"}, {"author_id": "51315943", "created_at": "2026-10-26T04:08:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114569927046963494"], "id": "2114569927046963494", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 252, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股三大指数今日低开震荡，截至午间收盘，上证指数跌0.18%，深证成指跌1.05%，创业板指跌1.65%。沪深两市半日成交额1.01万亿，较上个交易日缩量619亿。盘面上，全市场超2400只个股上涨。房地产板块走强，招商蛇口、大名城涨停。石油天然气、海运、白酒、游戏等板块涨幅居前。贵金属板块调整，赤峰黄金", "url": "https://x.com/lifeofchives/status/2114569927046963494"}, {"author_id": "51315943", "created_at": "2026-10-26T07:11:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114615855770374625"], "id": "2114615855770374625", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 85, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 10月26日A股收盘分析\n\nA股三大指数涨跌不一，上证指数+0.19%，深证成指-1.19%，创业板指-1.71%。两市成交额1.61万亿元，缩量3475亿元，超3100只个股下跌。\n\n🛢️ 石油天然气板块强势领涨，机器人概念冲高回落；半导体、贵金属板块走弱。", "url": "https://x.com/lifeofchives/status/2114615855770374625"}, {"author_id": "1999693479178567681", "created_at": "2026-10-27T11:29:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115043319591911747"], "id": "2115043319591911747", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 414, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天没看盘，\n没想到今日大A行情恶劣到这个地步！\n\n10月27日收盘：\n\n上证指数跌1.33%，报3648.30点；\n深证成指跌2.50%，报11245.73点； 创业板指跌3.41%，报2548.15点。\n\n全市场仅606家上涨，4922家下跌，49家平盘；44家涨停，28家跌停。\n两市成交额约1.46万亿元。", "url": "https://x.com/ZoXinkun2O26/status/2115043319591911747"}, {"author_id": "1657833427553644544", "created_at": "2026-10-27T05:22:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114950820383072625"], "id": "2114950820383072625", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 54, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【10月27日午盘涨停】指数绿盘震荡，汽车零部涨停潮！最高5连板的零售龙头是谁？\n \n大家好，我是曦曦。", "url": "https://x.com/Wingor33/status/2114950820383072625"}, {"author_id": "921529844", "created_at": "2026-10-26T09:50:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114655903622533217"], "id": "2114655903622533217", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 251, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 10月26日A股收评：沪指勉强翻红，创业板跌超1%，科技股调整何时结束？\n\n今天A股走出了明显的分化行情！\n\n截至收盘，上证指数上涨0.19%，报3697.52点；深证成指下跌1.19%，创业板指下跌1.71%。两市成交额约1.61万亿元，较上一交易日缩量约3475亿元，全市场超过3100只个股下跌。\n\n📉", "url": "https://x.com/rota_maria/status/2114655903622533217"}, {"author_id": "2108191189019381760", "created_at": "2026-10-26T07:53:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114626343736578479"], "id": "2114626343736578479", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 425, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📑📌高盛中国午评\n\n📈指数行情\n上证指数 -0.18%;上证 50 -0.59%\n深证成指 -1.05%;创业板指 -1.65%\n成交额 1.02 万亿元人民币;较上一交易日下降 15%\n🌏盘面简述\n受油价飙升、大型科技股财报披露前夕的影响,A", "url": "https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2114626343736578479"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1321270432385896448", "name": "小龙先生", "username": "Dragonhau66"}, {"id": "199